here from Khan Academy.

00:00:03.146 --> 00:00:05.896
Welcome to our Ed Talks live,

00:00:05.896 --> 00:00:08.976
this new flavor of
homeroom that we're doing.

00:00:08.976 --> 00:00:12.556
We have a very exciting
conversation with Brooke Mabry,

00:00:12.556 --> 00:00:14.806
about learning loss, summary slide,

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:17.806
and actually our partnership
with NWAEA as well.

00:00:17.806 --> 00:00:18.916
Before we jump into that,

00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:20.176
